{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-05","example":{"issue":{"title":"斜交市區路口，路權與空間是否清楚？","intro":"主要道路約 15 m、次要道路約 6.5 m，外側空間兼供停車。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-05-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"橫向來車提示不足","text":"主要道路缺少提醒駕駛留意橫向道路來車的警示。"},{"id":"space","title":"停車與行車空間混用","text":"外側車道兼供路邊停車，行車範圍不夠清楚。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限資訊不完整","text":"街廓較短，速限提示多依賴路面標字，需檢視提示的連續性。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[68,69],"strategy":{"title":"兼顧停車需求與轉角行人","intro":"以停車帶、人行道外擴與路口導引，整理市區斜交三岔路口。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-05-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"parking","title":"停車帶與行車空間分開","text":"配置嵌入式停車位，標清可停放與禁止停車的範圍。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"corner","title":"整理轉角與行人穿越","text":"以人行道路緣外擴調整轉角，讓轉彎車輛更容易注意行人。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"強化停讓與低速提示","text":"搭配停讓設施、路口導引線及本例30 km/h速限提示，說清楚路權與行進範圍。","moduleId":"M2-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-05-unsignalized-urban-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"5b98483294db3e43dffeadd32eb6515704f966fa5584acb6ec3509fafb7288ee","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-05-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況圖_01.png","width":3000,"height":2225,"label":"G1-05 現況圖","scenario":"G1-05","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":68,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image77.png","sha256":"6caec6e8bfde382eed3bfd96fc65ec96d5e54b3d521e4adc59737b35dd1bbe62"},"results:g1-05-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況照片_01.png","width":2572,"height":1412,"label":"G1-05 現況照片","scenario":"G1-05","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":69,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image79.png","sha256":"3d5d1605796a8d6772d472367aea1f402b3d2bc7463b9ad4dc531c070